    "summary": "Use Code Chivalric again when your turn begins if you have fulfilled your current oath. Pick a new deed and quality, or roll for them; replace a duplicate roll with an unchosen option. Stop when these options are exhausted. Models with Code Chivalric retain the benefits of the qualities of fulfilled oaths. Completing a further deed gives 1 CP instead of that deed’s normal reward, regardless of selection method.",
